Clustering and Knowledge Flow in WEKA
-------------------------------------

Part A: K-Means Clustering on Iris Dataset
Number of instances: 150
Number of attributes: 5

K-Means Results:
K       SSE
2       78.9
3       45.7
4       32.2
5       28.1

Best K: 3 (illustrative elbow selection)

Other Clustering Algorithms:
1. EM clustering performed.
