Part B: Knowledge Flow
1. Apriori and FPGrowth association rules.
2. J48 with 10-fold cross-validation.
3. ROC curve comparison: J48 and RandomForest.
4. ZeroR baseline classification.

ZeroR baseline accuracy: approximately 33.33%
J48 generally performs better than ZeroR on Iris.

Result: Clustering and classification workflow demonstrated.
